meta {
  name: 16 - AWS Dev Tooling
  seq: 17
}

docs {
  AWS dev manual setup, /api/local-dev/** tooling endpoints, and admin moderation helpers.

  Hosted dev requires Authorization: Bearer {{firebase_admin_id_token}} from an active Firebase-backed backend user whose verified Firebase email is allowlisted in BACKOFFICE_ADMIN_EMAILS. Protected /api/** requests also require X-Firebase-AppCheck: {{firebase_app_check_token}} when App Check is ENFORCED.

  Copy bruno/environments/dev.template.bru to an ignored env such as bruno/environments/dev.local.bru, fill Firebase Auth and App Check values, select it in Bruno, run 00b to store firebase_app_check_token, then run the Firebase Auth sign-in/provision requests before protected backend requests. Rerun 00b when the App Check JWT expires.
}
